":["The institution is established in all five supplied NIRF 2025 government listings and is independently present in the UGC private-university directory with the Sehore campus and official URL www.mguindia.com.","Normal TLS verification produced the managed proxy error 'self signed certificate in certificate chain'; curl --insecure was used only for public GET requests after confirming expected NIRF, UGC, search, official and official-site-linked CDN hostnames.","The official website is identifiable and its About Us and Contact pages confirm the university campus at Bilkisganj/Sehore. Some homepage marketing text emphasizes Bhopal, but the campus identity and district are confirmed as Sehore by the official site and UGC directory.","The official site has a current site-linked one-page Courses PDF, but the PDF and faculty pages are not fully consistent: the PDF lists abbreviated or additional programmes such as MPH, P B B.Sc (Nursing), M. Pharma, BAMS and MBBS, while faculty pages list additional web-only programmes and aliases. Several catalogue/faculty URLs returned HTTP 500 during public retrieval, including agriculture, arts, computer science, engineering technology, fashion and animation, hotel management, journalism and mass communication, library science and approvals/permissions.","Some official faculty entries use placeholder href='#' links, and the PDF prints D.Ed while the Faculty of Education page prints Diploma in Elementary Education (D.El.Ed). These inconsistencies make the official catalogue partial and require manual review.","Duration, eligibility and delivery mode were left null/not_stated for the batch record rather than normalizing conflicting page-specific claims. The central catalogue does not state those fields consistently.","The local career tree was queried read-only. Courses without exact nodes use labelled nearest-parent or closest-discipline mappings; the local bpharm, mcom and mba nodes contain outcome/label issues and are marked accordingly."]}